VPC internet edge" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f3e8ff;strokeColor=#9333ea;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=12;fontStyle=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=6;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="45" y="325" width="115" height="65" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="flow" value="TRAFFIC FLOW
1. User requests site over HTTPS.
2. Route 53 resolves domain (if configured).
3. ALB forwards to Elastic Beanstalk EC2 target in private app subnet.
4. Flask app queries PostgreSQL in private DB subnet.
5. Response returns via ALB.
6. NAT is for outbound connections only." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fffbeb;strokeColor=#d97706;dashed=1;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=8;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1410" y="425" width="230" height="185" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="notes" value="ACCURACY NOTES
• Elastic Beanstalk manages the environment and its EC2 application instances.
• App instances are in private app subnets; ALB is in public subnets.
• Six subnets shown across two AZs.
• Current Terraform sets RDS Multi-AZ to false: no standby DB is implied. Second DB subnet is part of subnet-group placement.
• Route 53 / ACM are conditional on custom domain and certificate setup.
• NAT count shown conceptually; confirm actual Terraform NAT configuration before deployment." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fffbeb;strokeColor=#d97706;dashed=1;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=8;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1410" y="630" width="255" height="220" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="1" value="DNS" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;strokeColor=#2563eb;strokeWidth=2;endArrow=block;endFill=1;" edge="1" parent="1" source="users" target="r53"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="2" value="TLS certificate" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;strokeColor=#2563eb;strokeWidth=2;endArrow=block;endFill=1;" edge="1" parent="1" source="r53" target="acm"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="3" value="HTTPS 443" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;strokeColor=#2563eb;strokeWidth=2;endArrow=block;endFill=1;" edge="1" parent="1" source="acm" target="alb"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="4" value="ALB target" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;strokeColor=#2563eb;strokeWidth=2;endArrow=block;endFill=1;" edge="1" parent="1" source="alb" target="alb_a"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="5" value="ALB target" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;strokeColor=#2563eb;strokeWidth=2;endArrow=block;endFill=1;" edge="1" parent="1" source="alb" target="alb_b"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="6" value="HTTP to EB target" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;strokeColor=#2563eb;strokeWidth=2;endArrow=block;endFill=1;" edge="1" parent="1" source="alb_a" target="eb_a"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="7" value="HTTP to EB target" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;strokeColor=#2563eb;strokeWidth=2;endArrow=block;endFill=1;" edge="1" parent="1" source="a